#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:4 ca040c97186c47fb9c4ffd57579eca3b
msgid "IMU Temperature Calibration"
msgstr "IMU 温度校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:6 d026586b7193445e8911f144c3dd35b6
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports IMU temperature calibration. Calibrating the IMU for "
"temperature changes can greatly reduce the amount of variation in the IMU "
"and helps with flying in conditions where the temperature varies a lot "
"between bootup and flight."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持 IMU 温度校准。对 IMU 进行温度变化校准可大幅减少 IMU "
"数据的漂移量，有助于在开机温度与飞行温度相差较大的环境中飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:8 23e7e5407d8e41bda1c1b46bb4c59155
msgid "this feature is only available currently on 2MB autopilots."
msgstr "此功能目前仅适用于 2MB 存储的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:10 b0d2033b5c1a43c1b7572d992cbd3820
msgid ""
"Temperature calibration is done by first setting up some parameters to "
"establish the start of a calibration routine on the next boot-up, then "
"taking the autopilot and placing it in a cold environment for several "
"minutes to establish a lower calibration temperature. Then, quickly re-"
"powering (and, optionally connecting to a GCS to monitor the process) in an "
"environment at the hotter, upper calibration point."
msgstr ""
"温度校准的步骤如下：首先设置相关参数，以便在下次启动时开始校准流程；然后将飞控置于低温环境中数分钟，建立较低的校准温度基准；之后在较高温度（即上限校准温度点）的环境中快速重新上电（可选连接地面站监控进度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:12 fb6612af1e594654aee198e73507ca45
msgid ""
"You must not allow the autopilot to move, once re-powered, until the "
"calibration is completed!"
msgstr "重新上电后，在校准完成之前，切勿移动飞控！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:14 eb33ce3011d44a9780bb198fc610c750
msgid ""
"After the calibration is complete, you can also run an Offline calibration "
"tool, to verify the calibration improvement."
msgstr "校准完成后，您还可以运行离线校准工具来验证校准的改善效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:16 0c24ba50c2934de5b32ea1fc60ca1be0
msgid ""
"The temperature calibration is stored in ArduPilot parameters, just like "
"other types of calibration parameters. There is also the option to store the"
" parameters in a way that persists across a full parameter reset, which "
"allows support for factory calibration for vendors selling ArduPilot "
"compatible autopilots."
msgstr ""
"温度校准数据与其他类型的校准参数一样，存储在 ArduPilot 参数中。此外，还可以选择将参数存储为在完全参数重置后仍能保留的方式，以支持销售 "
"ArduPilot 兼容飞控的厂商进行出厂校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:23 871a7131a8a942d492e617d812b3bf1b
msgid "Temperature Calibration Procedure"
msgstr "温度校准流程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:25 8fcfe35cac2f4ca0b047264b9b5bf1fa
msgid "The key factors to a good temperature calibration are:"
msgstr "良好温度校准的关键因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:27 26d166990dae4fef95dd051e5079a989
msgid ""
"letting the autopilot cool to a temperature below the minimum operating "
"temperature before starting the calibration"
msgstr "在开始校准前，让飞控冷却至低于最低工作温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:30 edc9d7de4adf4113a1384bcfae6e6a1d
msgid ""
"ensuring the IMU temperature that is reached during the calibration run is "
"high enough to cover all flight conditions"
msgstr "确保校准过程中达到的 IMU 温度足够高，能覆盖所有飞行条件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:33 422686cead624a58b65ed4591a6a5360
msgid ""
"ensuring that there is no movement during the calibration. Note that the "
"autopilot does not need to be level, but it must not move."
msgstr "确保校准期间飞控保持静止不动。注意飞控不必水平放置，但不能移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:37 ce19556293b84ff5b1eedcbfb9c066d6
msgid ""
"Before you start the calibration process you need to setup some key "
"parameters:"
msgstr "在开始校准流程之前，需要设置以下关键参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:40 19868fb275b1447c8640a452ff984037
msgid ""
"make sure the :ref:`INS_ACCn_CALTEMP <INS_ACC1_CALTEMP>` and "
":ref:`INS_GYRn_CALTEMP <INS_GYR1_CALTEMP>` parameters are already set (there"
" is one parameter per IMU, make sure you set all of them). These are set "
"automatically when you calibrate the accelerometers and gyroscopes. They "
"record the temperature of the IMU at the time the offsets were calibrated, "
"which is key information for the calibration process. If they are not "
"already set (they default to -300 which is an invalid value) then you need "
"to perform a 6-axis accel calibration."
msgstr ""
"确认 :ref:`INS_ACCn_CALTEMP <INS_ACC1_CALTEMP>` 和 :ref:`INS_GYRn_CALTEMP "
"<INS_GYR1_CALTEMP>` 参数已设置（每个 IMU "
"对应一个参数，确保全部设置）。这些参数在您校准加速度计和陀螺仪时会自动设定，记录了偏移量校准时的 IMU "
"温度，是温度校准流程的关键信息。如果这些参数尚未设置（默认值为 -300，表示无效值），则需要先进行六轴加速度计校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:50 8f18b3e17da04361acb2c6608c0041b0
msgid ""
"set :ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` to 2 for each IMU to enable "
"IMU temperature calibration learning on the each IMU you want to calibrate. "
"A value of 2 enables temperature calibration learning. The ENABLE parameter "
"value of 2 takes effect on the next boot."
msgstr ""
"将每个需要校准的 IMU 的 :ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` 设置为 2，以启用 IMU "
"温度校准学习。值为 2 表示启用温度校准学习，该 ENABLE 参数值将在下次启动时生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:56 0a44f2114f8a42979c818545b367204f
msgid ""
"set :ref:`INS_TCALn_TMAX <INS_TCAL1_TMAX>` to the temperature in degrees "
"centigrade that you want to stop the calibration. This should be the high "
"temperature that you expect to reach in your calibration run."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_TCALn_TMAX <INS_TCAL1_TMAX>` "
"设置为您希望停止校准时的温度（摄氏度）。该值应为校准过程中预期达到的最高温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:61 8787f61577814f38931a5ba1e653c580
msgid ""
"it is recommended that you ensure a microSD card is inserted and you have "
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` set to 1 to log the IMU data used in the "
"calibration process. While this is only required for the offline calibration"
" check below, using it for the initial calibration is recommended in case "
"you wish to inspect the raw data and to check for any movement that may have"
" disturbed the calibration process."
msgstr ""
"建议插入 microSD 卡，并将 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` 设置为 1，以记录校准过程使用的 IMU "
"数据。虽然这仅在执行下面的离线校准检查时是必需的，但初始校准时也建议启用，以便检查原始数据和可能影响校准的移动情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:68 c08153528c0b4d2fb4a82bae25e0dc5c
msgid ""
"For boards with a builtin IMU heater you may wish to raise "
":ref:`BRD_HEAT_TARG<BRD_HEAT_TARG>` to a higher than usual temperature. A "
"value of 70 can be good for calibration. Make sure you change it back to a "
"normal flight value (normally 45) when the calibration process is complete. "
"A value is 70 is likely to be above what can be reached, so for boards with "
"heaters a reasonable value for TMAX is 65 degrees C. Note that on some "
"boards (notably the Hex CubeBlack and CubeOrange) the 3rd IMU is not close "
"to the heater, so it's maximum temperature needs to be about 10 degrees "
"below the first two IMUs."
msgstr ""
"对于内置 IMU 加热器的主板，可将 :ref:`BRD_HEAT_TARG<BRD_HEAT_TARG>` 提高到比平时更高的温度，70 "
"度适合校准使用。校准完成后，务必将其恢复为正常飞行值（通常为 45）。70 度可能超出实际可达温度，因此对于带加热器的主板，TMAX 的合理值为 65 "
"摄氏度。注意，在某些主板上（特别是 Hex CubeBlack 和 CubeOrange），第三个 IMU 距加热器较远，其最高温度需比前两个 IMU "
"低约 10 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:79 16920526c1b14a1bb66e0b7cf7122ddb
msgid ""
"Once the parameters are setup, and the autopilot cooled to the minimum "
"temperature, you should power on the flight controller in a warm "
"environment, ensuring that it will not move throughout the calibration "
"process."
msgstr "参数设置完毕并将飞控冷却至最低温度后，应在温暖的环境中重新上电，确保整个校准过程中飞控不会移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:83 095651e0b1114ef4a60fb66447c5b019
msgid ""
"The calibration process has a 10 minute timeout. If an IMU doesn't increase "
"it's temperature by at least 0.5 degrees C over a 10 minute period then the "
"calibration will complete and the parameters will be saved up to the point "
"the temperature reached."
msgstr "校准流程有 10 分钟超时限制。如果某个 IMU 在 10 分钟内温度升幅未达到 0.5 摄氏度，校准将终止并保存截至该温度点的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:88 62f4bd18c00c4a979d7696f8f742532c
msgid ""
"The parameters are also saved for intermediate temperatures throughout the "
"calibration process. So if you run out of time (or patience) waiting for the"
" calibration then you can stop it at any time by powering off the board. If "
"you do this then you will need to manually change the :ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE"
" <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` parameters from 2 to 1 to enable the new calibration "
"data to be used. Otherwise it will start the calibration again on each boot."
" If you do interrupt the calibration process then you should power off the "
"vehicle with a minimum of movement or you could invalidate the calibration. "
"Stopping the calibration process by using a telemetry link to change the "
":ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` parameters to 1 before powering "
"off can also be done and is a good idea."
msgstr ""
"参数也会在校准过程中的中间温度点持续保存。因此，如果等待校准完成的时间不够（或失去耐心），可以随时关闭主板电源来停止校准。若这样做，则需要手动将 "
":ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` 参数从 2 改为 "
"1，以启用新校准数据的使用，否则每次启动时都会重新开始校准。如果中断了校准过程，应尽量减少关机时的移动，否则可能使校准失效。也可以通过数传链路将 "
":ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` 参数改为 1 后再关机，这是推荐做法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:101
#: eba0ac30a8f14fc2941efc878070402e
msgid ""
"Note that the calibration process requires a minimum of 10 degrees C change "
"in temperature between the starting and ending temperature. A range of at "
"least 25 degrees C is recommended, ie from the kitchen freezer to your desk."
msgstr "注意，校准流程要求起始温度和结束温度之间至少相差 10 摄氏度。建议温差至少为 25 摄氏度，例如从冰箱冷冻室到书桌温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:106
#: 9ad59a76bbfb49bdb2f4d7ab322bb3ac
msgid "Monitoring the Calibration Process"
msgstr "监控校准过程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:108
#: 7083931f4e2443beb82c443b28842fd1
msgid ""
"If you have a buzzer connected then you will here a short periodic beep "
"while the calibration is in progress. When the calibration is complete a "
"completion tune will play. If you have a mavlink telemetry link to the "
"vehicle then you can also monitor the progress via that link, graphing the "
"IMU temperatures (which are in the RAW_IMU, SCALED_IMU2 and SCALED_IMU3 "
"messages if you have mavlink2 enabled)."
msgstr ""
"如果已连接蜂鸣器，校准进行时会听到短暂的周期性蜂鸣声；校准完成时会播放完成音。如果通过 MAVLink 数传链路连接飞行器，也可通过该链路监控进度，绘制"
" IMU 温度图（在启用 MAVLink 2 时，温度数据在 RAW_IMU、SCALED_IMU2 和 SCALED_IMU3 消息中）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:115
#: 1dc8744597ac49b182a8d152e0da9ed9
msgid ""
"On completion the :ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` parameters will"
" change to 1 for \"enable\" for each IMU. Once all your IMUs have completed "
"calibration you can reboot the vehicle. You should also:"
msgstr ""
"校准完成后，每个 IMU 的 :ref:`INS_TCALn_ENABLE <INS_TCAL1_ENABLE>` 参数将变为 1（启用）。所有 IMU"
" 均完成校准后，可以重启飞行器。此外还应："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:120
#: ca4c123c02e14b86986f118fd5a948ec
msgid ""
"reset the :ref:`BRD_HEAT_TARG<BRD_HEAT_TARG>` back to its normal value "
"(usually 45) if you changed it"
msgstr "如果修改过 :ref:`BRD_HEAT_TARG<BRD_HEAT_TARG>`，将其恢复为正常值（通常为 45）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:123
#: 896a75bf3d0e4631bb49d688369ba3a6
msgid ""
"disable :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` if you had enabled it and want it"
" disabled for normal usage"
msgstr "如果为校准启用了 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` 且正常使用时不需要，则将其禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:126
#: 846c29eac7e849f39b314fd00c434227
msgid ""
"You may also wish to refresh your parameters and save all the parameters "
"that start with the INS_TCAL prefix. You can restore these parameters to "
"avoid needing a new temperature calibration if you ever do a complete reset "
"of your parameters."
msgstr "您也可以刷新参数并保存所有以 INS_TCAL 为前缀的参数。在完全重置参数后，可通过恢复这些参数来避免重新进行温度校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:132
#: fc060c19bf8049498e00e1fd16fdd4a4
msgid "Offline Calibration Tool"
msgstr "离线校准工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:134
#: 685482287cb640538fc70b65a35781e1
msgid ""
"The procedure outlined above will have completed an automatic online "
"temperature calibration. If you had :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` set "
"to 1 then the onboard log file allows you to do an offline calibration "
"check. Doing an offline calibration has the advantage that you can inspect "
"the improvements to the calibration by graphing the uncorrected and "
"corrected calibration for the accelerometers and gyroscopes."
msgstr ""
"上述流程已完成了自动在线温度校准。如果 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` 设置为 "
"1，则机载日志文件可用于进行离线校准检查。离线校准的优点是可以通过绘制加速度计和陀螺仪的未校正与已校正数据来直观检查校准改善效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:142
#: 2741092aa960444aa1b4963981b3c49c
msgid ""
"To perform an offline calibration you need to use the script in the "
"ArduPilot git repository in Tools/scripts/tempcal_IMU.py. When you run this "
"script on a log file from a calibration you will get two sets of graphs. One"
" set is for the gyroscopes the other is for the accelerometers."
msgstr ""
"进行离线校准需要使用 ArduPilot git 仓库中 ``Tools/scripts/tempcal_IMU.py`` "
"脚本。对校准日志文件运行此脚本后，将得到两组图表，分别对应陀螺仪和加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:147
#: 773fda5b5f1f46be99f3ca4fa5080b83
msgid ""
"The image below shows the results of a run on a log file for 3 IMU board:"
msgstr "下图显示了对一块三 IMU 主板的日志文件运行后的结果："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:155
#: 812a9a1a08f14fa59096b62b641fc337
msgid "The key features of the graphs are:"
msgstr "图表的主要特征包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:157
#: 1a036e7ce68448668dedc922b0cc9847
msgid ""
"the first 3 lines on each graph (blue, orange and green) show the "
"uncorrected IMU data. This allows you to see how much drift you have without"
" temperature correction"
msgstr "每张图中前三条曲线（蓝色、橙色和绿色）显示未经校正的 IMU 数据，可以看出不进行温度校正时的漂移程度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:161
#: 126ab064bf4c4880b5a716f2c7b98b68
msgid ""
"the next 3 graphs show the corrected IMU data, showing how much the "
"temperature calibration will help. For a good calibration these lines will "
"all be close to zero"
msgstr "后三张图显示已校正的 IMU 数据，体现温度校准的改善效果。校准良好时，这些曲线应接近零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:165
#: 82aad1da66ce4187892dd9d46458d802
msgid "the IMU temperature is shown on the right hand scale"
msgstr "IMU 温度显示在右侧纵轴"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:167
#: f540d5789e3e407db0fa4a2a30618bdb
msgid ""
"you should check for any sudden changes in the data, which indicates that "
"the board was not kept still when calibrating"
msgstr "应检查数据中是否有突变，这表明校准时主板发生了移动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:170
#: df83013e556f41dfa5c784a49ef007ca
msgid ""
"with multiple IMUs the graphs may span different temperature ranges and "
"times. This happens as the IMUs reach their target calibration temperatures "
"at different times"
msgstr "使用多个 IMU 时，图表可能覆盖不同的温度范围和时间段，这是因为各 IMU 在不同时间达到目标校准温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:174
#: 236f415c9ed14d77880e7ca97c043814
msgid ""
"The calibration script will also save a copy of the new calibration "
"parameters to the file tcal.parm, or a filename chosen with the --outfile "
"command line option. You should load these parameters to enable the new "
"calibration on the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"校准脚本还会将新校准参数的副本保存到文件 ``tcal.parm``，或通过 ``--outfile`` "
"命令行选项指定文件名。您应将这些参数加载到飞控以启用新校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:179
#: ae6d876504434128a6b2117b4c92d3a4
msgid "Other command line options are:"
msgstr "其他命令行选项包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:181
#: 6483a4be5b3d407b9fadba592495c943
msgid ""
"the --no-graph option disables the graphing, allowing for batch processing "
"of log files"
msgstr "``--no-graph`` 选项禁用图形显示，适用于批量处理日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:184
#: 0b611a9990c04940935c6182f0a0ed36
msgid ""
"the --online option changes the calibration process to use the same "
"algorithm as the online calibration method used inside the flight "
"controller. This is useful for debugging"
msgstr "``--online`` 选项将校准过程改为使用与飞控内部在线校准方法相同的算法，适用于调试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:188
#: 4a790fd5141f460da1c6d7493d083d01
msgid ""
"the --tclr option enables the use of the TCLR messages from the log instead "
"of the IMU log messages. The TCLR messages record the exact filtered data "
"used in the online calibration process. This is useful for debugging"
msgstr ""
"``--tclr`` 选项启用日志中 TCLR 消息的使用，而非 IMU 日志消息。TCLR 消息记录了在线校准过程中使用的精确滤波数据，适用于调试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:193
#: 14518568935b490f9df4df71cc5eaa3d
msgid ""
"the --log-parm option enables an additional set of graphs showing the IMU "
"data with corrections applied using existing INS_TCAL parameters from your "
"log file. This allows you to compare the new calibration against a previous "
"temperature calibration"
msgstr ""
"``--log-parm`` 选项启用额外一组图表，显示使用日志文件中现有 ``INS_TCAL`` 参数进行校正后的 IMU "
"数据，可用于将新校准与之前的温度校准进行比较"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:199
#: cb59caec719e480d9d2e65778dc97892
msgid "Factory Temperature Calibration"
msgstr "出厂温度校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:201
#: 5edbfac3ba84449aa6fe69c94a7990ff
msgid ""
"On autopilots based on the STM32F7 and STM32H7 microcontrollers we support "
"storing temperature calibration parameters in persistent storage in the "
"boards bootloader sector. This allows the calibration parameters to persist "
"even with a complete parameter reset, including changing firmware type. This"
" allows a vendor to ship autopilots pre-calibrated from the factory which is"
" a great convenience for users."
msgstr ""
"对于基于 STM32F7 和 STM32H7 "
"微控制器的飞控，支持将温度校准参数存储在主板引导程序扇区的持久存储中。这使得校准参数即使在完全重置参数（包括更换固件类型）后仍能保留。这允许厂商出厂时预先完成校准，为用户带来极大便利。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imutempcal.rst:209
#: def10e1b8e00458fb76891c0814011d4
msgid ""
"To save parameters persistently, you should set the desired bits in "
":ref:`INS_TCAL_OPTIONS <INS_TCAL_OPTIONS>` to indicate persistence of "
"Temperature Calibration and Accel Calibrations. As a final step send a "
"\"flash bootloader\" mavlink command to the autopilot. This will re-flash "
"the bootloader with calibration parameters embedded in the final part of the"
" bootloader sector in flash. You can inspect these parameters using the "
"@SYS/persistent.parm sysfs file using a mavftp client."
msgstr ""
"要持久保存参数，应在 :ref:`INS_TCAL_OPTIONS <INS_TCAL_OPTIONS>` "
"中设置所需位，以指示温度校准和加速度计校准的持久化。最后一步是向飞控发送「刷新引导程序」MAVLink "
"命令，这将重新烧写引导程序，并将校准参数嵌入到闪存中引导程序扇区的末尾部分。您可以使用 ``mavftp`` 客户端通过 "
"``@SYS/persistent.parm`` sysfs 文件检查这些参数。"
